# PROBE bottom-role. A ⊑ ∃owl:bottomObjectProperty.⊤ makes A unsatisfiable: the empty role has no successor.
# construct: built-in role (bottomObjectProperty)
# expect: unsat :A
# expect-not: unsat :B

@prefix :     <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .
:A a owl:Class . :B a owl:Class .
:A rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty owl:bottomObjectProperty ; owl:someValuesFrom owl:Thing ] .
